    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An individual line item of an order. Each instance represents one product on one order, together with the price charged at the time of the order, the quantity ordered, and any discount applied. This is a junction entity linking Orders to Products; its identity is determined by the composite key (orderID, productID).</rdfs:comment>
